  "title": "How to prioritize your resources from a risk management perspective",
  "summary": "As published in the new CGI-Governing Institute “Guide to Cybersecurity as Risk Management,” too often, a compliance-based approach to cybersecurity planning is unable to evolve with a public or private organization’s changing needs. A more effective alternative is a risk-based approach where organizations must understand their critical assets and the financial, reputational and regulatory risk should those assets be exposed.",
